    skyBlip Bravo, a Seeed SenseCAP MeshTracker X1, carries no ADS-L radio
    under skyBlip firmware: it receives ADS-B on 1090&nbsp;MHz and transmits
    nothing, so no ADS-L declaration covers it. Its CE document is Seeed&rsquo;s
    <a href="https://files.seeedstudio.com/Seeed_Certificate/documents_certificate/100093876-CE.pdf">verification of compliance LGT26F105C01</a>,
    issued by Shenzhen LGT Test Service on 8 Sep 2026 under the Radio Equipment
    Directive.
  </p>
